        "selector": "JSXOpeningElement[name.name='Tag'] > JSXAttribute > JSXIdentifier[name!=/^(?:children|active|onRemove|onClick|key|ref|className|style|children)$/]",
        "message": "<Tag> doesn't accept that prop. Declared props: children, active, onRemove, onClick."
